/// M07 CORE-029 "bundled Noul judge: 3 assert roots green".
/// Source: tests/integration/judge_test.go symbol
/// TestCurrentBundledNoulJudge.
/// Related fixture: compiler/testdata/current/native/noul.can (read at Go
/// L67, staged pristine as src/main.can at L72 with only the endpoint
/// rewritten to the test server at L71; the blank-descriptor mutation at
/// L110 and the handler-fault mutation at L123 apply to later legs only,
/// never the assert leg; the "native" raw fixtures stage at L73).
/// Disposition: RETAIN (migrate row; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row, variant, environment and
/// control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): canlc assert green with a passed report carrying
/// exactly 3 roots grounded per function in noul.can: report 1, likelihood
/// 0 (asks branches only, no asserts block), assess 1, main 1. The report
/// carries the supplied-completion label (Go L95).
/// Live judge semantics (supplied completion, live provider batch, stage
/// rejection of invalid/blank/faulty variants, raw-provider drive) live in
/// core-029-judge-semantics.can; the production process shape lives in
/// core-029-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: none in this file (default only); invalid answer (Go L103-107),
/// blank descriptor (L108-118), faulty handler (L120-132) and raw provider
/// (L134-202) belong to the judge-semantics file.
/// Environment: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE + macOS sandbox-exec; requires
/// can-bun-archive, macos-sandbox-exec. CAN_I17_TOKEN is harness-supplied
/// (Go L79: "test-only"), not an external gate. Logical gates SUITE/DIAG/
/// FAULT and C/R/N/S/A identities bind at P23/QHTTP; no live run now.
/// Descriptor timeout 120000ms mirrors the Go 2-minute ctx (L27).
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23/QHTTP unmet).
/// Case bundled/judge-roots checks: assert-green, report-passed,
/// root-count, fixture-name, report-roots, likelihood-roots, assess-roots,
/// main-roots.
/// Facet map (judge_test.go legs): assert-green pins the assert leg
/// (L95-97: status 0 and empty diagnostics or the test fatals "ordinary
/// Noul consumer assertions"); report-passed pins the passed report
/// (derived from the L95 exit-0 pin: canlc assert exits nonzero on
/// failure); root-count pins the three roots (fixture asserts blocks:
/// report L18-19, assess L45-47, main L57-58); fixture-name grounds the
/// pins in the staged fixture (L67: noul.can; L72: src/main.can);
/// report-roots pins report (fixture L18-19 direct, 1 root);
/// likelihood-roots pins likelihood (fixture L31-38: asks branches only,
/// no asserts block, 0 roots); assess-roots pins assess (fixture L45-47
/// sample with the raw noul_assess.json fixture, 1 root); main-roots pins
/// main (fixture L57-58 sample, 1 root).
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later integrator decision.
